{"id":"forecast-17","section":3,"path":"bank/listening/forecast-17/audio-3.mp3","model":"small","duration":448.71,"segments":[{"start":0.08,"end":5.22,"text":"Section 3 You will hear two students called Tom and","words":[["Section",0.08,0.72],["3",0.72,1.2],["You",1.2,2.64],["will",2.64,2.8],["hear",2.8,3.02],["two",3.02,3.38],["students",3.38,4.0],["called",4.0,4.4],["Tom",4.4,4.8],["and",4.8,5.22]]},{"start":5.22,"end":12.14,"text":"Bella attending the third meeting of the After School Club. They are talking with their professor","words":[["Bella",5.22,5.6],["attending",5.6,6.58],["the",6.58,6.94],["third",6.94,7.3],["meeting",7.3,7.68],["of",7.68,8.14],["the",8.14,8.28],["After",8.28,8.56],["School",8.56,8.94],["Club.",8.94,9.3],["They",10.1,10.66],["are",10.66,10.8],["talking",10.8,11.12],["with",11.12,11.42],["their",11.42,11.62],["professor",11.62,12.14]]},{"start":12.14,"end":61.26,"text":"about the furniture company. First you have some time to look at questions 21 to 26. Now","words":[["about",12.14,12.58],["the",12.58,12.88],["furniture",12.88,13.28],["company.",13.28,13.84],["First",15.1,15.54],["you",15.54,16.28],["have",16.28,16.5],["some",16.5,16.72],["time",16.72,17.16],["to",17.16,17.46],["look",17.46,17.64],["at",17.64,17.8],["questions",17.8,18.18],["21",18.18,19.06],["to",19.06,19.52],["26.",19.52,20.12],["Now",61.24,61.26]]},{"start":61.26,"end":65.36,"text":"Thanks for coming in today to talk about the key case studies that will help you to understand","words":[["Thanks",61.26,61.38],["for",61.38,61.5],["coming",61.5,61.66],["in",61.66,61.88],["today",61.88,62.16],["to",62.16,62.4],["talk",62.4,62.6],["about",62.6,62.86],["the",62.86,63.08],["key",63.08,63.26],["case",63.26,63.64],["studies",63.64,64.0],["that",64.0,64.34],["will",64.34,64.5],["help",64.5,64.7],["you",64.7,64.84],["to",64.84,64.94],["understand",64.94,65.36]]},{"start":65.36,"end":66.6,"text":"your classwork better.","words":[["your",65.36,65.62],["classwork",65.62,66.26],["better.",66.26,66.6]]},{"start":67.72,"end":71.94,"text":"Now I hope you've read the notes I gave you last week on the furniture company Willows,","words":[["Now",67.72,67.82],["I",67.82,67.94],["hope",67.94,68.08],["you've",68.08,68.3],["read",68.3,68.42],["the",68.42,68.56],["notes",68.56,68.78],["I",68.78,69.0],["gave",69.0,69.24],["you",69.24,69.38],["last",69.38,69.62],["week",69.62,69.88],["on",69.88,70.16],["the",70.16,70.4],["furniture",70.4,70.9],["company",70.9,71.42],["Willows,",71.42,71.94]]},{"start":72.52,"end":74.84,"text":"as this will be the focus of our discussion today.","words":[["as",72.52,72.98],["this",72.98,73.12],["will",73.12,73.28],["be",73.28,73.38],["the",73.38,73.5],["focus",73.5,73.74],["of",73.74,74.0],["our",74.0,74.12],["discussion",74.12,74.44],["today.",74.44,74.84]]},{"start":75.52,"end":76.0,"text":"Let's begin.","words":[["Let's",75.52,75.8],["begin.",75.8,76.0]]},{"start":76.46,"end":79.94,"text":"Who can tell me what the current focus of the company's business is?","words":[["Who",76.46,76.58],["can",76.58,76.72],["tell",76.72,76.96],["me",76.96,77.26],["what",77.26,77.54],["the",77.54,77.66],["current",77.66,78.0],["focus",78.0,78.42],["of",78.42,78.68],["the",78.68,78.78],["company's",78.78,79.26],["business",79.26,79.52],["is?",79.52,79.94]]},{"start":81.0,"end":85.56,"text":"The company used to be very large, with many retail outlets across the country.","words":[["The",81.0,81.5],["company",81.5,81.82],["used",81.82,82.12],["to",82.12,82.24],["be",82.24,82.32],["very",82.32,82.54],["large,",82.54,82.98],["with",83.28,83.52],["many",83.52,83.72],["retail",83.72,84.16],["outlets",84.16,84.76],["across",84.76,85.02],["the",85.02,85.24],["country.",85.24,85.56]]},{"start":86.24,"end":90.92,"text":"However, since the recession, there have been fewer people spending money on furniture.","words":[["However,",86.24,86.8],["since",87.2,87.44],["the",87.44,87.64],["recession,",87.64,88.06],["there",88.6,88.82],["have",88.82,88.92],["been",88.92,89.04],["fewer",89.04,89.32],["people",89.32,89.6],["spending",89.6,89.96],["money",89.96,90.32],["on",90.32,90.48],["furniture.",90.48,90.92]]},{"start":91.52,"end":96.36,"text":"And so the company was forced to close all of its outlets, and now only operates online.","words":[["And",91.52,91.72],["so",91.72,91.92],["the",91.92,92.04],["company",92.04,92.28],["was",92.28,92.48],["forced",92.48,92.66],["to",92.66,92.88],["close",92.88,93.14],["all",93.14,93.5],["of",93.5,93.58],["its",93.58,93.7],["outlets,",93.7,94.0],["and",94.46,94.8],["now",94.8,95.1],["only",95.1,95.48],["operates",95.48,95.9],["online.",95.9,96.36]]},{"start":97.44,"end":98.48,"text":"Well done, Tom.","words":[["Well",97.44,98.0],["done,",98.0,98.24],["Tom.",98.3,98.48]]},{"start":99.32,"end":100.66,"text":"Abela, can you add anything?","words":[["Abela,",99.32,99.68],["can",99.86,99.96],["you",99.96,100.12],["add",100.12,100.4],["anything?",100.4,100.66]]},{"start":101.76,"end":107.42,"text":"Willows used to produce a very large number of products, such as tables, chairs, and","words":[["Willows",101.76,102.32],["used",102.32,102.6],["to",102.6,102.82],["produce",102.82,103.12],["a",103.12,103.36],["very",103.36,103.64],["large",103.64,104.02],["number",104.02,104.42],["of",104.42,104.64],["products,",104.64,105.08],["such",105.44,105.7],["as",105.7,105.92],["tables,",105.92,106.3],["chairs,",106.74,107.02],["and",107.32,107.42]]},{"start":107.42,"end":108.12,"text":"light fittings.","words":[["light",107.42,107.64],["fittings.",107.64,108.12]]},{"start":108.52,"end":114.08,"text":"However, through market research, they realized that most of their profit was made from the","words":[["However,",108.52,108.94],["through",109.3,109.48],["market",109.48,109.86],["research,",109.86,110.46],["they",110.84,110.98],["realized",110.98,111.48],["that",111.48,111.88],["most",111.88,112.18],["of",112.18,112.4],["their",112.4,112.52],["profit",112.52,112.98],["was",112.98,113.44],["made",113.44,113.7],["from",113.7,113.94],["the",113.94,114.08]]},{"start":114.08,"end":118.56,"text":"sale of bookcases, so they now specialize in this one product.","words":[["sale",114.08,114.4],["of",114.4,114.56],["bookcases,",114.56,115.2],["so",115.64,115.88],["they",115.88,116.08],["now",116.08,116.34],["specialize",116.34,116.84],["in",116.84,117.44],["this",117.44,117.66],["one",117.66,118.02],["product.",118.02,118.56]]},{"start":119.58,"end":123.5,"text":"Very good. Does anyone know how our department began its contact with Willows?","words":[["Very",119.58,119.86],["good.",119.86,120.1],["Does",120.36,120.5],["anyone",120.5,120.72],["know",120.72,121.06],["how",121.06,121.28],["our",121.28,121.48],["department",121.48,121.86],["began",121.86,122.36],["its",122.36,122.6],["contact",122.6,122.98],["with",122.98,123.22],["Willows?",123.22,123.5]]},{"start":124.34,"end":126.32,"text":"Did you contact the company, Professor?","words":[["Did",124.34,124.84],["you",124.84,125.02],["contact",125.02,125.36],["the",125.36,125.54],["company,",125.54,125.9],["Professor?",126.22,126.32]]},{"start":127.06,"end":128.82,"text":"No, Tom, it wasn't through me.","words":[["No,",127.06,127.58],["Tom,",127.7,127.86],["it",128.04,128.08],["wasn't",128.08,128.4],["through",128.4,128.62],["me.",128.62,128.82]]},{"start":129.68,"end":134.02,"text":"Our headmaster saw an article that the manager had written in the newspaper","words":[["Our",129.68,129.96],["headmaster",129.96,130.6],["saw",130.6,131.14],["an",131.14,131.36],["article",131.36,131.78],["that",131.78,132.12],["the",132.12,132.26],["manager",132.26,132.6],["had",132.6,132.92],["written",132.92,133.24],["in",133.24,133.46],["the",133.46,133.56],["newspaper",133.56,134.02]]},{"start":134.02,"end":136.98,"text":"and became very interested in the company.","words":[["and",134.02,134.74],["became",134.74,135.12],["very",135.12,135.56],["interested",135.56,136.14],["in",136.14,136.44],["the",136.44,136.56],["company.",136.56,136.98]]},{"start":137.58,"end":143.18,"text":"He contacted Willows and arranged for a student to work their full time during the summer.","words":[["He",137.58,137.74],["contacted",137.74,138.34],["Willows",138.34,138.86],["and",138.86,139.4],["arranged",139.4,139.8],["for",139.8,140.1],["a",140.1,140.32],["student",140.32,140.56],["to",140.56,140.86],["work",140.86,141.12],["their",141.12,141.34],["full",141.34,141.7],["time",141.7,142.06],["during",142.06,142.6],["the",142.6,142.82],["summer.",142.82,143.18]]},{"start":143.18,"end":149.24,"text":"Yes, exactly. Does anyone know what the student thought of their time working at Willows?","words":[["Yes,",143.18,144.18],["exactly.",144.48,145.0],["Does",145.86,146.18],["anyone",146.18,146.4],["know",146.4,146.74],["what",146.74,146.9],["the",146.9,147.06],["student",147.06,147.34],["thought",147.34,147.7],["of",147.7,147.9],["their",147.9,148.04],["time",148.04,148.4],["working",148.4,148.74],["at",148.74,148.92],["Willows?",148.92,149.24]]},{"start":150.08,"end":155.32,"text":"Yes, he is a friend of ours. He worked as a member of the design team, creating technical","words":[["Yes,",150.08,150.58],["he",150.72,150.8],["is",150.8,150.9],["a",150.9,150.98],["friend",150.98,151.14],["of",151.14,151.3],["ours.",151.3,151.48],["He",152.32,152.52],["worked",152.52,152.74],["as",152.74,152.9],["a",152.9,152.98],["member",152.98,153.16],["of",153.16,153.38],["the",153.38,153.48],["design",153.48,153.78],["team,",153.78,154.1],["creating",154.48,154.84],["technical",154.84,155.32]]},{"start":155.32,"end":160.54,"text":"drawings of the furniture using a computer. There was a special software that he used,","words":[["drawings",155.32,155.64],["of",155.64,155.9],["the",155.9,156.0],["furniture",156.0,156.32],["using",156.32,156.74],["a",156.74,156.92],["computer.",156.92,157.3],["There",158.22,158.82],["was",158.82,158.98],["a",158.98,159.1],["special",159.1,159.36],["software",159.36,159.86],["that",159.86,160.04],["he",160.04,160.16],["used,",160.16,160.54]]},{"start":161.0,"end":166.74,"text":"which he said had a bad interface and was very difficult to predict. However, it was","words":[["which",161.0,161.18],["he",161.18,161.3],["said",161.3,161.62],["had",161.62,162.1],["a",162.1,162.2],["bad",162.2,162.4],["interface",162.4,162.82],["and",162.82,163.14],["was",163.14,163.24],["very",163.24,163.44],["difficult",163.44,163.82],["to",163.82,164.04],["predict.",164.04,164.4],["However,",165.24,165.84],["it",166.22,166.44],["was",166.44,166.74]]},{"start":166.74,"end":170.4,"text":"very efficient and helpful for quickly drawing up furniture designs.","words":[["very",166.74,167.08],["efficient",167.08,167.48],["and",167.48,167.94],["helpful",167.94,168.32],["for",168.32,168.58],["quickly",168.58,168.82],["drawing",168.82,169.18],["up",169.18,169.44],["furniture",169.44,169.82],["designs.",169.82,170.4]]},{"start":171.44,"end":178.06,"text":"how interesting yes it was we both visited him whilst he was working there","words":[["how",171.44,172.08],["interesting",172.08,172.52],["yes",172.52,173.72],["it",173.72,174.1],["was",174.1,174.44],["we",174.44,175.2],["both",175.2,175.52],["visited",175.52,175.98],["him",175.98,176.38],["whilst",176.38,176.94],["he",176.94,177.2],["was",177.2,177.38],["working",177.38,177.72],["there",177.72,178.06]]},{"start":178.06,"end":183.9,"text":"and he showed us around unfortunately visitors were not allowed to access the","words":[["and",178.06,178.56],["he",178.56,178.72],["showed",178.72,179.02],["us",179.02,179.22],["around",179.22,179.62],["unfortunately",179.62,180.78],["visitors",180.78,181.84],["were",181.84,182.2],["not",182.2,182.48],["allowed",182.48,182.9],["to",182.9,183.16],["access",183.16,183.58],["the",183.58,183.9]]},{"start":183.9,"end":189.56,"text":"IT department but it was great to chat with his colleagues did you meet his","words":[["IT",183.9,184.28],["department",184.28,184.74],["but",184.74,185.54],["it",185.54,185.66],["was",185.66,185.